# Wanted Griffin has flying: on turn 3 it attacks; Bot2's Memnite (no flying or reach) may not block it, Bot2's Ornithopter (flying) may. Ornithopter blocks, takes 3 and
# dies; the Griffin takes no damage (Ornithopter has 0 power), so it did not die and no Mercenary token was made.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Wanted Griffin
Plains x3
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x5
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wanted Griffin.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Wanted Griffin > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Memnite > Wanted Griffin)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Wanted Griffin)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Wanted Griffin.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Wanted Griffin.Damage = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Mercenary Token = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Life = 20
